{"title": "1 Level check (question)", "html": "<div style=\"width:1440px;height:900px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#f2f2ef;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;padding:8px 72px 0;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"padding:32px 0 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6\"><div style=\"flex:1;font:500 19px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Do you fully understand how a language model turns text into the next word?</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex:none\"><span style=\"padding:11px 22px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #8a8a8f;color:#18181a;background:#ffffff;font:650 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif\">Yes</span><span style=\"padding:11px 22px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #8a8a8f;color:#18181a;background:#ffffff;font:650 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif\">No</span></div></div><div style=\"font:650 28px/1.15 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#18181a;margin-top:22px\">What a language model does</div></div><div style=\"margin:22px 0 40px;flex:1;border:1px dashed #b4b4b8;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:#fbfbfa\"><div style=\"font:500 10.5px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">Fig 1</div><div style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#8c8c90;max-width:420px;text-align:center\">Answer No and this figure opens. Yes moves on to the next level.</div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:72px;bottom:6px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><span style=\"font:500 10px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">Main concept</span><span style=\"font:600 14px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">How an AI coding agent works</span><span style=\"font:400 12px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#8c8c90\">Explained after the basics it needs</span></div></div>"}